        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the one Santa always passed by. Not a single gift in your entire life—just an empty space under the tree. Years of disappointment have brought you to his doorstep. You won't ask. It's time to demand what's yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what you find behind the door has nothing to do with children's fairy tales. The workshop is working on something completely different, and his assistants are looking at you with unnatural interest. It becomes clear that some Christmas secrets are better left undisclosed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916370/extras/ad0d49bfd62137185bf2d4ca8a9edac5.poster.avif?t=1780051277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916370/extras/ad0d49bfd62137185bf2d4ca8a9edac5.webm?t=1780051277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916370/extras/ad0d49bfd62137185bf2d4ca8a9edac5.mp4?t=1780051277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop waiting for gifts. It's time to take them. Take everything you can carry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a creepy lair filled with deadly secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying creatures that serve Santa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the main secret of the New Year's workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling horror:</strong> Forget about the fairy-tale Santa. You'll meet the Butcher from the North, a creature in a bloodstained red and white robe whose sack is meant for far more terrifying “gifts.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The atmosphere of a holiday turned nightmare:</strong> Explore a terrifying lair where joyful garlands twinkle above pools of blood, and New Year's melodies, distorted beyond recognition, create a unique atmosphere of anxiety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
